      "id": "claim_932e09c98973406291ac53c3551b6c61",
      "statement": "Because OpenUI composes its shorthand text tokens from its default font (for example textBodyDefault is '400 16px/1.5 \"Inter\", sans-serif'), overriding fontBody alone does not change rendered OpenUI text; typographyTokens() therefore rebuilds every text* shorthand containing \"Inter\", giving body tokens the reading font and all other text tokens the sans stack.",
